@* Topo das páginas internas. Com Aside, vira duas colunas (texto à esquerda, imagem à direita). *@
<section class="sec hero hero-page @(Aside is null ? "" : "hero-has-aside")">
    <div class="wrap @(Aside is null ? "" : "hero-split")">
        <div>
            <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/@Lang">@Home</a> / @Crumb</p>
            <h1 class="display">@Rich.Render(Title)</h1>
            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Lead))
            {
                <p class="lead">@Rich.Render(Lead)</p>
            }
            @ChildContent
        </div>
        @if (Aside is not null)
        {
            <div class="hero-aside">@Aside</div>
        }
    </div>
</section>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Lang { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Home { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Crumb { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Title { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter] public string? Lead { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Aside { get; set; }
}
